              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka ku haahingwireho emyaka ebiri, Felikisi yaahungurirwa Porokio Festo; kandi Felikisi, ahabw'okwenda kusiimwa Abayudaaya, yaatsiga Paulo omu kihome.",
